I really wanted to have something that interacts with the actual digital world that can do knowledge work.

114
00:06:32,964 --> 00:06:35,501
지식노동을 할 수 있는 뭔가를 원했어요.

115
00:06:35,501 --> 00:06:38,843
그런데 결과적으로 그건 너무
