예를 들어 제 글에서
든 예는 얼룩말이었어요.
For example, my example in the post was the zebra.

157
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:59,280
얼룩말은 태어나고 몇 분만 지나면
뛰어다니면서 어미를 따라가요.
A zebra gets born, and a few minutes later it's running around and following its mother.

158
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,708
그건 정말 엄청나게 복잡한 일이에요.
That's an extremely complicated thing to do.

159
00:09:01,708 --> 00:09:03,596
그건 강화학습이 아니에요.
That's not reinforcement learning.

160
00:09:03,596 --> 00:09:05,192
그건 이미 타고난 거예요.
That's something that's baked in.

161
00:09:05,192 --> 00:09:08,319
진화가 우리 신경망의 가중치를
ATCG로 인코딩하는 방법을
Evolution obviously has some way of encoding the weights of our neural nets in ATCGs, and I have no idea how that works, but it apparently works.

162
00:09:08,319 --> 00:09:11,349
갖고 있다는 건 분명한데,
그게 어떻게 작동하는지는 전혀

