If there were a single algorithm that you can just run on the Internet and it learns everything, that would be incredible.

185
00:10:11,820 --> 00:10:15,960
알고리즘이 있다면, 그건
정말 대단한 일일 거예요.

186
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:19,985
그런 게 존재하는지는 잘
모르겠고, 확실히 동물들이 하는
I'm not sure that it exists and that's certainly not what animals do, because animals have this outer loop of evolution.

187
00:10:19,985 --> 00:10:24,400
방식도 아니에요. 동물에게는
진화라는 외부 루프가 있으니까요.

188
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:28,400
학습처럼 보이는 것 중 많은
부분은 사실 뇌의 성숙에 가까워요.
A lot of what looks like learning is more like maturation of the brain.

189
